      "title": "Instructions",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Models auto-download on first run**  \nNo manual setup needed.\n\nSelect the model you want in **model_path**.\n\n## Default model: s2-pro-fp8\nRequires about **20 GB VRAM**\n\n| Model | VRAM | Size |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| s2-pro (bf16) | ~24 GB | ~10 GB |\n| s2-pro-fp8 | ~20 GB | ~8 GB |\n| s2-pro-BNB-int8 | ~20 GB | ~10 GB |\n| s2-pro-BNB-nf4 | ~16 GB | ~10 GB |\n\n## Manual download\n\nDownload **all files** for the selected model.\n\n| Model | Size | Download | Path |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n| s2-pro (bf16) | ~10 GB | [Open files](https://huggingface.co/fishaudio/s2-pro/tree/main) | `ComfyUI\\models\\fishaudioS2\\s2-pro` |\n| s2-pro-fp8 | ~8 GB | [Open files](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/s2-pro-fp8/tree/main) | `ComfyUI\\models\\fishaudioS2\\s2-pro-fp8` |\n\n## !!! RESEARCH & NON-COMMERCIAL USE LICENSE\n\n## [Read More HERE](https://huggingface.co/fishaudio/s2-pro/blob/main/LICENSE.md)\n"
      ],
